{"title":"AGAIN","artist":"Crusher","sourceId":"reference:xXseEtgK2hh1SoEjCKVL","sourceHash":"63fddfbe570245bf82d7e565b269270da8bcffa3f7b25f7a63070ce7b5cc471c","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":26410687,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":13.57,"end":16.32,"text":"I haven't been myself lately","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":16.32,"end":20.51,"text":"I don't blame you for not wanting to stay","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":20.51,"end":26.51,"text":"Saying things that I don't mean, not meaning what I say","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.51,"end":28.54,"text":"When it's good, it's so good","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":28.54,"end":30.06,"text":"When it's bad, it's so bad!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":30.06,"end":33.52,"text":"Even when I knew what I had","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.52,"end":36.22,"text":"What am I supposed to say","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":36.22,"end":40.23,"text":"When I end up driving everyone away?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.23,"end":42.71,"text":"'Cause I am on fire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":42.71,"end":46.17,"text":"A crying, burning liar","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":46.17,"end":47.22,"text":"Seeing nothing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":47.22,"end":48.03,"text":"Nothing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":48.03,"end":49.43,"text":"But myself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":49.43,"end":53.58,"text":"And I'm the one with the lighter!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":53.58,"end":55.25,"text":"Every inch of me is charred","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":55.25,"end":56.99,"text":"God, what happened to my heart?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":56.99,"end":58.64,"text":"I'm about to fall apart","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":58.64,"end":59.59,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":59.59,"end":60.37,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":60.37,"end":61.98,"text":"And you're never coming back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":61.98,"end":63.98,"text":"And I'm not okay with that","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":63.98,"end":66.91,"text":"And I should've never let myself get attached","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":66.91,"end":67.53,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":67.53,"end":68.37,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":68.37,"end":69.26,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":69.26,"end":70.16,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":70.16,"end":70.91,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":70.91,"end":71.75,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":71.75,"end":72.72,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":72.72,"end":75.08,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":86.57,"end":89.21000000000001,"text":"What's done is done","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":89.21000000000001,"end":92.95,"text":"And nothing's gonna change","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":92.95,"end":95.97999999999999,"text":"I should be moving on","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":95.97999999999999,"end":99.43,"text":"But I still feel the same","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":99.43,"end":101.49000000000001,"text":"And it's like every day","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":101.49000000000001,"end":103.15,"text":"Is a fight for my life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":103.15,"end":106.25999999999999,"text":"To get some self-control","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":106.25999999999999,"end":107.81,"text":"And when you've forgotten","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":107.81,"end":110.78,"text":"Who I am, it just feels, it just feels","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":110.78,"end":113.87,"text":"Like I'm nobody at all","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":139.57,"end":143.19,"text":"I found myself hitting the ground","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":143.19,"end":146.32,"text":"I held my breath in case I drown","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":146.32,"end":149.6,"text":"I should have known when to let go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":149.6,"end":153.82,"text":"And when to see who I was being","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":153.82,"end":155.49,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":155.49,"end":157.06,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":157.06,"end":159.32,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":159.32,"end":161.94,"text":"I am on fire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":161.94,"end":165.15,"text":"A crying, burning liar","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":165.15,"end":166.5,"text":"Seeing nothing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":166.5,"end":167.11,"text":"Nothing","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":167.11,"end":168.74,"text":"But myself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":168.74,"end":172.6,"text":"And I'm the one with the lighter!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":172.6,"end":174.54,"text":"Every inch of me is charred","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":174.54,"end":176.12,"text":"God, what happened to my heart?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":176.12,"end":177.87,"text":"I'm about to fall apart","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":177.87,"end":178.51,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":178.51,"end":179.43,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":179.43,"end":180.92,"text":"And you're never coming back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":180.92,"end":183.03,"text":"And I'm not okay with that","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":183.03,"end":186.01,"text":"And I should've never let myself get","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":186.01,"end":187.74,"text":"Every inch of me is charred","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":187.74,"end":189.28,"text":"God, what happened to my heart?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":189.28,"end":191.0,"text":"I'm about to fall apart","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":191.0,"end":191.98,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":191.98,"end":192.78,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":192.78,"end":194.45,"text":"And you're never coming back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":194.45,"end":196.34,"text":"And I'm not okay with that","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":196.34,"end":199.49,"text":"And I should've never let myself get attached","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":199.49,"end":200.14,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":200.14,"end":200.91,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":200.91,"end":201.89,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":201.89,"end":202.65,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":202.65,"end":203.32,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":203.32,"end":204.22,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":204.22,"end":205.14,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":205.14,"end":206.07999999999998,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":206.07999999999998,"end":206.84,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":206.84,"end":207.57999999999998,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":207.57999999999998,"end":208.24,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":208.24,"end":209.24,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":209.24,"end":210.19,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":210.19,"end":210.89,"text":"Again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":210.89,"end":213.45,"text":"Again, again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":213.45,"end":215.04,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":215.04,"end":216.71,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":216.71,"end":218.43,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":218.43,"end":219.96,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"89","start":219.96,"end":221.55,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"90","start":221.55,"end":223.25,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"91","start":223.25,"end":225.6,"text":"Again!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"92","start":225.6,"end":227.36,"text":"And you're never coming back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"93","start":227.36,"end":229.4,"text":"And I'm not okay with that","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"94","start":229.4,"end":233.99,"text":"And I should've never let myself get attached!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"95","start":233.99,"end":236.46,"text":"Woah!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"96","start":236.46,"end":238.18,"text":"Again!","translat